<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 108,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 108,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog marketings was 108,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA said. Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts steady to $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession Thursday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
